                h2 
                    | Do you like OUR WORK so far?
                    br
                    | Let's talk about YOUR PROJECT!
                a GET IN TOUCH
            .posts 
                .wrapper
                    h2 RECENT BLOG POSTS 
                    span.grey_line
                    p.des Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consetetur sadipscing elitr amet
